# Opcodes this fixture acknowledges as not-yet-legalised. Each later
# 7-stage should be able to delete entries from this file as it ships.
#
# jmp — dispatcher `jmp dword ptr [ebp + next_pc]` (added by stage
#       7c1) and the trailing `jmp dword ptr [ecx]` of stage 7d1's
#       epilogue rewrite. Both are mov-equivalent indirect jumps
#       through memory; the objdump gate treats them as accepted
#       non-mov mnemonics.
#
# Already legalised: sub (stage 7d0), pop ebp + ret (stage 7d1),
# push ebp (stage 7d2).
jmp
